    ai: 'Leverage: patient-education material, documentation, literature search. Pressure is lowest at the bedside and in procedures, and higher in documentation, coding and transcription.',
    sales: 'Patients and families pay. They trust a licence, local reputation and referrals. First skill: a clear price conversation and asking every satisfied patient or client who else they know.',
    watch: 'Joining a college whose approval and attached hospital you did not verify.',
  },
